  "notes": [
    "Apple iPhone does not expose a large universal engineering-code system like Android.",
    "Many entries in this database are GSM/MMI or carrier service codes rather than Apple-exclusive codes.",
    "Carrier, country, SIM/eSIM, network technology and iOS version can affect availability.",
    "A code marked carrier_dependent should not be presented as guaranteed to work on every iPhone.",
    "Codes that change call-forwarding, call-waiting, caller-ID or call-barring settings should be treated as network-service commands.",
    "Obsolete or poorly supported codes are excluded from the primary dataset.",
    "Security-bypass, Activation Lock bypass and account-bypass techniques are excluded.",
    "Destructive device-reset commands are excluded."
  ],

